WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.601
-Guys, we have exactly
four shows left

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:04.234
before we go on Christmas break,
which means it's time for

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.868
that beloved "Tonight Show"
tradition.

00:00:05.868 --> 00:00:08.968
It's time for "12 Days of
Christmas Sweaters."

00:00:08.968 --> 00:00:10.167
Here we go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:12.567
-♪ 12 days of
Christmas sweaters ♪

00:00:12.567 --> 00:00:16.501
♪ Four days left ♪

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:18.100
-That's right.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.868
Every show between now and
Christmas, we'll be giving

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:24.167
one lucky audience member
a phenomenal Christmas sweater

00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:25.968
from the "Countdown to
Christmas" cabinet.

00:00:25.968 --> 00:00:29.000
Now...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.801
Since there are
four shows left --

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:35.367
wow -- let's open door
number four.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.667
[ Drum roll ]
Ooh, that's right in the middle.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:39.968
Go for it, bud,
whenever you're ready.

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:42.067
Ah! Very nice.

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:44.467
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.167
Beautiful.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.701
Oh!

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:49.133
Wow. It lights up.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:52.133
Can we dim the lights
a little bit?

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.067
I thought it lit up.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:56.601
Oh, it lights up when you move?

00:00:56.601 --> 00:00:57.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:57.667 --> 00:01:00.133
I don't know what -- Wow.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.467
Oh, yeah.

00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:02.868
Alright. Alright.

00:01:02.868 --> 00:01:04.934
Wow. It just kind of blinks
when it wants to blink.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:06.267
Alright, here we go.

00:01:06.267 --> 00:01:08.334
Let's see who's going home with
tonight's sweater, okay?

00:01:08.334 --> 00:01:09.868
Everyone look at
your seat number.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.667
If I call your number,
come on down.

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.734
Quest, can I get a drum roll,
please?

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.234
[ Drum roll ]

00:01:17.234 --> 00:01:20.267
Seat number 4-3-3!

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:22.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:27.767
♪♪

00:01:27.767 --> 00:01:29.000
Yo!

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.601
♪♪

00:01:31.601 --> 00:01:33.667
Hey!

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:36.434
Welcome, welcome, welcome.

00:01:36.434 --> 00:01:37.801
Wow.

00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:39.334
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:41.300
This is going to be more
like a dress for you.

00:01:41.300 --> 00:01:42.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:43.667
What is your name?

00:01:43.667 --> 00:01:44.968
-I'm Jessica.

00:01:44.968 --> 00:01:46.133
-Jessica, where are you from,
Jessica?

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:48.234
-Colombia.
-Colombia, oh, my goodness!

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:51.400
[ Cheers and applause ]
Jessica, welcome to the show.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.167
-Thank you.
-Thank you for being here.

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:54.667
Do you have anything like this
at home?

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.067
-No.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:56.067 --> 00:01:57.868
Well, would you like to
try it on right now?

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.567
-Well, I feel so happy
to be here,

00:02:00.567 --> 00:02:02.200
especially for this present.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.067
I was talking with a guy before.

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:07.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.667 --> 00:02:10.067
They know.
-Is everything okay?

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:12.334
-The cold weather is crazy
for me here

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:16.200
because in my country it is
warm, so this is perfect.

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:18.100
-Try it on.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:20.067
I think it'll look great on you.

00:02:20.067 --> 00:02:23.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:24.634
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.501
Yeah. Oh, yeah. Look at this.

00:02:30.501 --> 00:02:31.834
There's no wrong way
to wear it.

00:02:31.834 --> 00:02:33.267
Oh, my good-- Look at this!

00:02:33.267 --> 00:02:35.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
Look at that! Come on now!

00:02:35.801 --> 00:02:37.100
Yes!

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.033
Oh, it's so beautiful.

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:41.234
Congratulations.
It'll keep you warm.

00:02:41.234 --> 00:02:43.667
Welcome. Thank you for being
here. I appreciate it.

00:02:43.667 --> 00:02:45.601
One more time for our audience
member right there.

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:46.734
Stick around.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:48.801
When we come back,
we're singing

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.701
a special Christmas song
with Matthew McConaughey!

00:02:51.701 --> 00:02:52.801
Come on back!

00:02:52.801 --> 00:02:55.634
♪♪
[ Cheers and applause ]

